  'limpopo-reopens-2027-school-admissions-late-applicants-2026-11-20',
  'Limpopo reopens 2027 school applications for parents who missed the first round',
  'Community', '2026-11-20', 'Review Online', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2026/11/20/missed-the-deadline-limpopo-reopens-2027-school-admissions/',
  'Parents in Limpopo who missed the first round of 2027 school applications can apply from 19 November at 08:00 until 30 November at 23:59.',
  'The Limpopo Department of Education has opened a second window for 2027 school admissions, aimed at parents and guardians who did not manage to apply during the first phase. That first phase started on 27 July. The late window opened on Thursday, 19 November 2026 at 08:00 and closes on 30 November 2026 at 23:59.

How you apply depends on the grade. For the entrance grades, Grade R, Grade 1 and Grade 8, parents submit the application on the department''s web-based system for learner admissions. For the internal grades, Grade 2 to 7 and Grade 9 to 12, applicants must go in person to one of the department''s set admission points and submit on paper.

According to the department, it reopened admissions because families who could not apply earlier had asked it to. It also says placement disputes arising from the first round are still being addressed. Reports note that placement depends on factors such as available classroom space, each school''s admission policy, home address, distance from the school and whether a sibling already attends.

Parents are urged to submit their applications inside the window, give accurate information and attach all the required supporting documents so that processing is not delayed. Applying to more than one school is encouraged. Anyone unsure which admission point serves their area should ask the department or a nearby school before the 30 November closing time.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.citizen.co.za/review-online/news-headlines/local-news/2026/11/20/missed-the-deadline-limpopo-reopens-2027-school-admissions/", "https://www.limpopochronicle.co.za/2026/11/18/limpopo-department-of-education-reopens-learner-admission-for-2027/"]',
  'agent'
);
